Package: @@PACKAGE@@
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: @@VENDOR@@ <maintainers@astraos.invalid>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://astraos.invalid
Depends: fonts-dejavu-core, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: plymouth, plymouth-themes, grub2-common, lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter
Suggests: inkscape
Description: AstraOS visual identity
 The AstraOS brand assets and the configuration that points system components at them:
 wallpapers, the AstraOS ring logo in colour and monochrome, the AstraOS icon theme,
 the Plymouth boot splash, the GRUB theme, and the LightDM greeter assets.
 .
 All artwork is original to the AstraOS project. No asset is copied from another
 distribution and no third-party logo or trademark is redistributed. The palette and
 the generated bitmaps both derive from config/branding.env, so the identity has a
 single source of truth in the source tree.
 .
 The upstream LightDM greeter configuration file is written at image build time
 because lightdm-gtk-greeter owns that path as a configuration file; the drop-in
 /etc/lightdm/lightdm.conf.d/50-astraos.conf is shipped by this package.
